      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Jake and the team at Evergreen were exactly the installer I'd hoped to find when we started looking for quotes. Fast to respond, happy to answer all our questions, and were more than happy to tailor their quotes to our specific wants.They also didn't miss a beat when we decided to change our mind from a Sungrow system to a Sigenery system after we'd already pulled the trigger and were waiting for the install day. The only hiccup along the way was delays in Sigenergy stock deliveries, which was obviously out of their control, so no complaints there.On the day, the crew arrived bright and early, walked us through the plan, and helped us finalise the location for the battery. And even though replacing our existing SolarEdge inverter required all of the panels to be taken down to remove the optimisers, they still managed to complete the whole job that day. No fuss, no mess.The system has been humming along perfectly since then. I expect their after-sales support is also great, but the install and system seem to be good enough that we may never find out!",
