      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The initial quoting process was great. Evergreen were completely open to offering any combination of brands I wanted. After doing thorough research and gauging offerings from other quotes, I pestered them for quotes on a tonne of different configurations. They were more than happy to oblige and I appreciate that. They were up front about the discounted pricing they could get on the panel brand I was looking for too, which is the type of transparency I look for. Out of all the quotes I received for the same configuration, Evergreen's was the best value for money.On installation day, the Evergreen team liaised with me to confirm where I wanted the inverter. They did a quick assessment on roof layout. I have various skylights and vents scattered across the roof, but they did a good job fitting the whole system up there working around these obstacles. I'm extremely pleased with the way it turned out.The team walked me through the setup, and confirmed I had access to the cloud app. They also notified me of all the paperwork that needed to be signed and would be submitted by them.",
